00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:17.459
The ring finger represents his marriage to
his wife, with whom he is unfaithful.

00:13:17.459 --> 00:13:21.480
He tries to reattach these fingers, to patch
these mistakes that he has made.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:25.710
But because his character is not genuine,
they never mesh back in this his body and

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:29.320
he just ends up ripping them out again.

